  "bodyHash": "oqPOdXJyJNk=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/stoneborn_text.png?raw=true\" /> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">STONEBORN 是一款受奇幻作品啟發的簡約獨特 UI 改造包。視覺上柔和舒適，裝飾輕盈且風格統一，無論是原版還是模組遊玩都非常適合。</span> </span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em>冒險之路危險重重，帶上 STONEBORN 踏上你的下一段旅程吧！</em> </span></strong></span></p>\n<p><br /><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">查看其他 STONEBORN 系列資源包：</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-dwarven-fantasy-inspired-ui-overhaul\"><br /> </a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/stoneborn-gear\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/CFgear.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/stoneborn-odds-ends\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/CFOaE.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" />&nbsp;</a></span></p>\n<p><br /> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: #ff0000; text-decoration: underline;\">關於重新發布及與其他模組相容性的重要條款：</span></span></strong></em></span></div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">請<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">不要</span>在 Modrinth、Planet Minecraft、CurseForge 或任何其他託管或論壇頁面上重新發布本資源包檔案。如需引用或提供連結給他人，請連結至本 CurseForge 頁面。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">請<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">不要</span>聲稱擁有所有權或將本資源包當作自己的作品發布。如需在其他地方引用或提供連結，請妥善標明出處（Sindavar）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">你可以為了與其他模組的 UI 相容而創作或編輯本資源包內的素材。但這些資源包只能包含所取代模組的捆綁素材，且不能包含基礎的 STONEBORN 紋理包。（你的模組支援包需在遊戲中載入於 STONEBORN 之上）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">你可以隨意託管這些資源包，但請連結回 STONEBORN 頁面作為依賴，並向我給予應有的標註。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">你不能將 STONEBORN 與其他資源包捆綁，然後在 Modrinth 或任何其他地方重新發布。我理解這對伺服器等可能帶來的便利，但這會影響我的收益及本頁面的下載量。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">你可以為了<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">個人使用</span>而編輯或創作 STONEBORN 的素材，但這些編輯過的檔案不得以任何形式重新發布。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">如果你對這些條款有任何疑問，或對重新發布／編輯資源包有疑問，請與我聯絡。 </span><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">如果你發現任何未經授權的重新發布、錯誤標註來源或違反上述條款的情況，請讓我知道。</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">開發者備註：</span></strong></em></span></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">我一直在尋求改進作品，因此非常歡迎大家對資源包提出建議。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">使用非英文語言可能導致部分文字元素無法顯示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">本資源包（希望能夠）在 1.17 之後的未來《Minecraft》版本中持續維護。資源包將不支援舊版本。<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">歡迎在下方留言區回報你遇到的任何問題，非常感謝你的關注 :)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">有疑問？透過 Discord 私訊我，或在 Discord 伺服器中提問！</span><br /><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-size: 14px;\">- Sindavar</span><br /></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /> </span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">在其他平台支持我，並加入 Discord！</span></em></span></strong></span></h1>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Sindavar33\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/twitter.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sindavart/\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/ig.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/sindavar/\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/pmc.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" />&nbsp;</a> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/sindavar\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/heart.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/MF2z3KZp8Z\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/discord.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> </span><br /> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/stoneborn\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e367a0c4-0cf1-4832-bf34-643c5b8f0742.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\" /> </a></span><br /> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></p>",
